        "eyebrow": "Fortune Forged",
        "heading": "BMW F8X (F80 / F82) Wheel & Tire Fitment Guide",
        "intro": "<p>Forged-only wheel and tire configurations for BMW F80 M3 and F82 M4. Square setups favor rotation and understeer control; staggered setups prioritize rear traction. Specs below use Fortune Forged offsets — 11\" rears at ET40 and 9.5\" fronts at ET15 where those widths apply. Optional photos can be added to each configuration in the theme editor.</p>",
        "footnote": "Tire fitment notes are general guidance based on common setups. Final tire choice, spacers, and camber requirements are confirmed by our fitment specialists for your exact build. Suspension clearance can change with coilovers and ride height. Fortune Forged produces forged wheels only.",
